OL,3,AHabitat destroyed by Cairngorms fire to
OL,4,Abe restored with government funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #1m is to be spent on nature
OL,7,Frecovery projects, including the
OL,8,Frestoration of habitats destroyed by a
OL,9,Ffire which ripped through a huge area
OL,10,Fof hillside in the Cairngorms.
OL,12,FThe Scottish government funding will
OL,13,Fsupport habitat, species and river
OL,14,Frestoration, control of invasive
OL,15,Fnon-native species and deer management
OL,16,Facross Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
