OL,3,AHabitat destroyed by Cairngorms fire to
OL,4,Abe restored with government funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt includes #150,100 for recovery and
OL,7,Fnature restoration work following the
OL,8,FAbernethy wildfire in the Cairngorms in
OL,9,FJuly, to restore damaged habitats, help
OL,10,Fwildlife recover and reduce the risk of
OL,11,Ffuture wildfires.
OL,13,FFurther funding will be provided to a
OL,14,Frange of other projects.
